  "review": "The final source retains all definitions and public theorem statements, adds an acyclic import of ArithmeticCellPhysical and delegates proofs to existing results. The initial candidate added Classical.choice and Quot.sound to early_reset_numeric; the final candidate restores its original kernel-decide proof and original axiom report. All 71 pinned source hashes and recorded local import edges matched the working tree during independent review; all 12 prerequisite object hashes matched both overlays. No warnings appeared in the scoped checks.",
  "limitations": [
    "The five local sources NativePellBootstrap, SidonPositions, SignedPellResidue, ThirteenFreshSeed and ThirteenCarrierSoundness had newer timestamps than their cached objects; this is not a fully fresh dependency closure. External dependencies remained precompiled.",
    "The prerequisite logs, timing files and source/object hashes were preserved, but individual shell invocations for the five newly built prerequisites were not captured in the phase records.",
    "The initially tested candidate is retained separately with its axiom-difference logs.",
    "Timings are single observations under concurrency, not evidence of a general speedup.",
    "Prior receipts record the source and object hash provenance of borrowed builds; compiled objects and symlinks are excluded."
  ]
